This company is a subsidiary of the High Tech XL Group BV, a private company with Limited Liability, incorporated, organised and existing under the laws of the Netherlands.

The objects of Hand controller BV are:
a. to develop, manage and commercialize technology for medical applications in the field of hand rehabilitation therapy; 
b. to participate in, to manage, to finance, to conduct the management of and to provide advice and services to other companies or enterprises;
